From: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 14:10:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] virtio_msg: ffa: add common code

Add shared virtio message FF-A protocol definitions, transfer-method policy helpers, endpoint registries, and inbound classification logic.

This common layer is used by the FF-A driver and device roles and by the indirect, FIFO, and direct transfer implementations.

Signed-off-by: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
---
 drivers/virtio/Kconfig                       |  13 +
 drivers/virtio/Makefile                      |   4 +
 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa.h          | 321 ++++++
 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa_common.c   | 988 +++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa_protocol.h | 227 +++++
 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa_xfer.h     | 175 ++++
 6 files changed, 1728 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa_common.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa_protocol.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/virtio/virtio_msg_bus_ffa_xfer.h

